        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DoralLock 6410, Morant Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe classic design and easy installation of the DoralLock Morant Lever, will not disappoint those looking for a simple leverset that will improve the look of any space. The circular rose has concealed screw mounting (installation screws are hidden) for a very sleek look. It fits any standard 2-1/8 inch bore hole door preparation. This leverset will fit 1-3/8 inch and 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses with an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. And since this lever is available in single dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed entry functions, you will be sure to find just what you are looking for.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of DoralLock Morant Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install, this lever fits standard pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Keyed entry function is ANSI rated grade 2 security.</li>\r\n<li>Keyed entry function is 5 pin Kwikset compatible keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed, field reversible lever.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Morant Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw Hole Spacing: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Spindle Length: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DOR-6410-specifications.pdf?v=1704262175\" target=\"new\"><b>DoralLock 6430 Morant Lever Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim. Complete Set - 1 lever and 1 rose.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two levers.  Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch and strike plate</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a finger turn located in the middle of the lever. In an emergency, it can unlock from the exterior using a coin or a screwdriver. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (keyed Lock):</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. An ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 2 security lock that is operated by a key from the exterior and a finger turn on the lever from the interior. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Morant Leverset, DoralLock 6410",
                "description": "DoralLock 6410, Morant Lever - The classic design and easy installation of the DoralLock Morant Lever, will not disappoint those looking for a simple leverset that will improve the look of any space. The circular rose has concealed screw mounting (installation screws are hidden) for a very sleek look. It fits any standard 2-1/8 inch bore hole door preparation. This leverset will fit 1-3/8 inch and 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses with an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. And since this lever is available in single dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed entry functions, you will be sure to find just what you are looking for.",
                "keywords": "DOR-6410, dorallock 6410 Morant levers, dorallock 6411 entry Morant levers, dorallock 6412 privacy Morant levers, dorallock 6413 passage Morant levers, dorallock 6414D single dummy Morant lever, classic levers, traditional levers, grade 2 keyed entry levers, residential levers, deltana Morant levers, Morant leversets, solid brass levers,"
